   "text": "You call the doctor's office. Many learners say: I want a doctor.",
   "gap": 0.7
  },
  {
   "id": "t1",
   "text": "Pause and guess. What sounds polite?",
   "gap": 0.7
  },
  {
   "id": "t2",
   "text": "Say: I'd like to make an appointment, please.",
   "gap": 0.7
  },
  {
   "id": "t3",
   "text": "I'd like is soft. It sounds polite.",
   "gap": 0.7
  },
  {
   "id": "t4",
   "text": "Is 'I want a doctor' polite on the phone? No.",
   "gap": 0.7
  },
  {
   "id": "t5",
   "text": "Repeat after me: I'd like to make an appointment, please.",
   "gap": 0.7
  },
